  "method": "Independent full-scope source review against the frozen manifest, reading every assigned implementation, test, script and workflow rather than relying on prior audit conclusions. Semantically traced authentication and exact browser/worker leases, admission and activity locks, durable receipt reservation/dispatch/settlement/replay, recovery proofs and rotation, automation schedules and lifecycle, registered projects/worktrees, provider and execution-mode interfaces, bounded transport resources, exact test selection, source-bound authorization/preflight, CI platform skip reconciliation and release scanner. Reviewed test fixture setup, synchronization, assertions and declared platform exclusions. Added non-executing syntax/transform checks for all TS/ESM and Python scripts. Reproduced one post-acknowledgement project-registration failure with an in-memory Ledger, controlled successful worker responses and actual task-local directory creation. Initial and final SHA-256 checks match all 78 frozen file entries; hashes establish identity only, not semantic correctness.",
